# =================================================================
# Direct Gmail Delivery Configuration (Recommended)
# =================================================================
# To send emails directly from your Gmail account without any 3rd party
# middleman, follow these two quick steps:
#
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/security
#
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password under "App Passwords":
#    https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (Select App: "Mail", Device: "Other (Portfolio)")
#
# 3. Create a ".env.local" file in the root directory and paste:
#    EMAIL_USER=portfolioOwner@gmail.com
#    EMAIL_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
# =================================================================
